---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Simulations | Your Name">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Simulations</p>
    <h1>Interactive computational simulations</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A structured collection of browser-based scientific demos for exploration, explanation, and learning.
    </p>
    <div class="quick-nav">
      <a href="#live-labs">Live labs</a>
      <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
      <a href="#methods">Methods</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reading-section">
    <article id="live-labs">
      <h2>Live simulation labs</h2>
      <p>Interactive pages with adjustable parameters and direct visual feedback.</p>
      <ul class="muted-list">
        <li><a href="/labs/brownian/">Brownian motion lab</a></li>
        <li><a href="/labs/markov-chain/">Markov chain lab</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article id="roadmap">
      <h2>Simulation roadmap</h2>
      <p>Upcoming additions include Monte Carlo, Ising models, and molecular dynamics demos.</p>
      <ul class="muted-list">
        <li>Metropolis and MCMC diagnostics</li>
        <li>Lattice spin systems and phase transitions</li>
        <li>Particle-based dynamics and observables</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article id="methods">
      <h2>Computational methods</h2>
      <p>Each simulation links to source code and mathematical context for reproducible understanding.</p>
      <ul class="muted-list">
        <li><a href="/computational-notes/">Quarto notes for derivations and methods</a></li>
        <li><a href="/notes/">Quartz notes for conceptual network links</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
